# 10. TOKEN LIMITS BANK CUSTOMIZATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Custom error message returned when an AI model or combo limit bank is exceeded
LIMIT_BANK_EXCEEDED_MESSAGE="Token limit bank exceeded for this model. Please contact administrator or upgrade your limit bank."
